<title>GERMANY: German Apr import prices fall 0.2 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German Apr import prices fall 0.2 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES    Apr 97	Mar 97	Apr 96</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  -0.2	  unch	 +0.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +2.1	  +2.7	 +0.8</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991)  100.3	100.5	 98.2</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  +0.3	  +0.2	 +0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +1.0	  +0.8	 +0.6</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 104.7	 104.4	103.7</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
